	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_DOCTOR_TALK_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンずかんの
ちょうしは　どう？▼
なんて　きいちゃうけど
ほんとうは　たびを　たのしんでよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:47:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモン図鑑の
ちょうしは　どう？▼
なんて　きいちゃうけど
本当は　旅を　楽しんでよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:03:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:16:56" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:29:59" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_DOCTOR_TALK_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンずかんは
ポケモンを　つかまえることで▽
くわしい　じょうほうを　えられるわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T06:38:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:48:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモン図鑑は
ポケモンを　捕まえることで▽
詳しい　情報を　得られるわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:04:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:48:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:16:56" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:48:36" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_DOCTOR_TALK_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンずかんの　ページを
うめることは　じゅうよう　だけど▼
ポケモンと　むきあうことの　ほうが
１００ばいも　１０００ばいも▽
じゅうよう　なの　わすれないでね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T07:22:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:48:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモン図鑑の　ページを
埋めることは　重要だけど▼
ポケモンと　向き合うことの　ほうが
１００倍も　１０００倍も▽
重要なの　忘れないでね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:04:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:48:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:16:56" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:48:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_DOCTOR_TALK_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かくちの　ポケモンはかせと
ちからを　あわせ▽
ポケモンの　なぞに　いどむ▼
それでも　すべての　なぞは
ときあかせないけれど　すこしずつ▽
なにかが　わかっていけば▼
あとに　つづく　けんきゅうしゃに
なにか　のこせていけるのよね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:05:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:48:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>各地の　ポケモン博士と
力を　あわせ▽
ポケモンの　なぞに　挑む▼
それでも　すべての　なぞは
解き明かせないけれど　すこしずつ▽
なにかが　わかっていけば▼
あとに　続く　研究者に
なにか　残せていけるのよね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:05:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:48:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:16:56" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:48:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_DOCTOR_TALK_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンずかんの
なにが　パワーアップすれば▽
みんな　うれしいのかな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T07:20:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:48:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモン図鑑の
なにが　パワーアップすれば▽
みんな　うれしいのかな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:05:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:48:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:16:56" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:48:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_DOCTOR_TALK_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きみたちを　みてると
バックパッカーだったころを▽
おもいだして　やるき　でるわね！▼
そうなの！　わたしも
ポケモンずかんを　もって▽
イッシュちほうを　たびしたのよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T07:16:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きみたちを　みてると
バックパッカーだったころを▽
思い出して　やる気　でるわね！▼
そうなの！　わたしも
ポケモン図鑑を　持って▽
イッシュ地方を　旅したのよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:05:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:16:56" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:45" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_DOCTOR_TALK_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わたしが　バックパッカーの　ころ
あなたの　ママと　しりあったの！▼
ポケモンセンターの　うけつけで
はなしこんじゃって▽
すごい　ぎょうれつ　つくったっけ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:06:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わたしが　バックパッカーの　ころ
あなたの　ママと　知り合ったの！▼
ポケモンセンターの　受付で
話しこんじゃって▽
すごい　行列　つくったっけ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:06:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:16:56" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:45" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_DOCTOR_TALK_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>せかいには　きっと
まだ　みたことのない▽
ポケモンが　いるのよね！▼
ねっ！　そうぞうしたら
ワクワクするでしょ！？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T07:03:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>世界には　きっと
まだ　みたことのない▽
ポケモンが　いるのよね！▼
ねっ！　想像したら
ワクワクするでしょ！？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:07:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:16:56" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:45" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_DOCTOR_TALK_09"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ゆめは　おおきく！▼
ぜんせかいの　ポケモンと
であってほしいな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T06:40:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>夢は　大きく！▼
全世界の　ポケモンと
であってほしいな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:07:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:16:56" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:45" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
