	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_GREET_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんだよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:15:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なんだよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:15:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……だいじな　ものは
じぶんの　ちからで　まもりたいよな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T07:02:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……大事な　ものは
自分の　力で　守りたいよな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:08:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:15:16" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンしょうぶに　つよい　ヤツが
ただしいって　わけじゃないけど▽
まけたら　なにも　いえないよな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:08:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモン勝負に　強い　ヤツが
正しい　って　わけじゃないけど▽
負けたら　なにも　いえないよな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:08:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:15:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>よるに　なって
しずまりかえった　とき▼
みみを　すませば
ポケモンの　あしおとが　きこえる▼
そういうのが　すき　なんだよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T06:54:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>夜に　なって
静まりかえった　とき▼
耳を　すませば
ポケモンの　足音が　きこえる▼
そういうのが　好き　なんだよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:09:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:15:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>じぶんに　じしんが　あれば
そして　ポケモンが　いてくれるなら▽
みちに　まようことも　たのしめる▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T06:53:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>自分に　自身が　あれば
そして　ポケモンが　いてくれるなら▽
道に　迷うことも　楽しめる▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:09:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:15:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どんな　ポケモンが　いたら
てもちポケモンの　じゃくてんを▽
カバーできるか　かんがえてた▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T06:50:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どんな　ポケモンが　いたら
てもちポケモンの　弱点を▽
カバーできるか　考えてた▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:09:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:15:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:08" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どんな　りゆうが　あろうが
ひとの　ものを　とったら　ドロボウさ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T06:47:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どんな　理由が　あろうが
ひとの　ものを　とったら　ドロボウさ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:09:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:15:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どんな　ふうに　そだてて
つよくしようか　かんがえるのは▽
たのしい　じかん　だよな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T06:47:01" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どんな　風に　育てて
強くしようか　考えるのは▽
楽しい　時間だよな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:10:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:15:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>このみで　いえば
すばやい　ポケモン　かな……？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T06:45:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>好みで　いえば
すばやい　ポケモン　かな……？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:10:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:15:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_09"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あっ　わるい▼
やりたいこと　あるんで
また　あとで！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T06:44:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あっ　悪い▼
やりたいこと　あるんで
また　あとで！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:10:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
