・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:15:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:04:53" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_TALK_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……んー
とくに　はなすこと　ないけど▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T06:39:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
