			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いま　どこ　って？▼
ヒウンシティの　すみから　すみまで
プラズマだんを　さがしてるよ！▼
オマエも　みつけてないんだろ？▼
いいか！
ぜったいに　みつけだすぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:56:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いま　どこ　って？▼
ヒウンシティの　すみから　すみまで
プラズマ団を　探してるよ！▼
オマエも　みつけてないんだろ？▼
いいか！
絶対に　みつけだすぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:10:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>目的地メッセージ
・下水道イベントクリア前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:54:22" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さっきは　たすかった！▼
オレは　まだ　ヒウンで
プラズマだんを　さがすけどさ▼
おまえは　ポケモンジムに
いけば　いいんじゃないか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:56:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さっきは　助かった！▼
オレは　まだ　ヒウンで
プラズマ団を　探すけどさ▼
おまえは　ポケモンジムに
行けば　いいんじゃないか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:11:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>目的地メッセージ
・c03ポケモンジム前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:54:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヒウンの　ポケモンジムで
ビートルバッジを　とった？▼
だったら　つぎは
ライモンシティに　いって▽
ジムリーダーに　ちょうせん　すれば？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T09:27:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヒウンの　ポケモンジムで
ビートルバッジを　とった？▼
だったら　次は
ライモンシティに　行って▽
ジムリーダーに　挑戦すれば？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T09:27:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>目的地メッセージ
・c04ポケモンジム前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:54:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんだよ▼
ホドモエの　ポケモンジムに
ちょうせん　したのか？▼
まだなら　いけば　いいだろ！▼
ちなみに　ジムリーダーは
じめんタイプの　つかいて　らしいぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:18:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なんだよ▼
ホドモエの　ポケモンジムに
挑戦したのか？▼
まだなら　行けば　いいだろ！▼
ちなみに　ジムリーダーは
じめんタイプの　使い手らしいぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:11:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>目的地メッセージ
・c05ポケモンジム前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:54:27" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さっき　ヤーコンの
おっさんに　いわれただろ？▼
ホドモエの　トーナメントに
さんか　してくれって！▼
トーナメントは　ホドモエシティの
みなみに　あるってさ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:20:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さっき　ヤーコンの
おっさんに　いわれただろ？▼
ホドモエの　トーナメントに
参加してくれって！▼
トーナメントは　ホドモエシティの
南に　あるってさ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:11:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>目的地メッセージ
・ホドモエトーナメント優勝前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:54:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きいてる　ばあいか！
プラズマだん　だぞ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:08:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きいてる　場合か！
プラズマ団　だぞ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:12:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>目的地メッセージ
・プラズマフリゲート１回目クリア前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:54:31" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そうだな……▼
オマエの　じつりょく　なら
フキヨセの　ジムリーダーにも▽
かてるんじゃないか？▼
まっ　オレは　もう
ジェットバッジ　てにいれたけどな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:08:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そうだな……▼
オマエの　実力なら
フキヨセの　ジムリーダーにも▽
勝てるんじゃないか？▼
まっ　オレは　もう
ジェットバッジ　手にいれたけどな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:12:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>目的地メッセージ
・c06ポケモンジムクリア前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:54:37" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ひとこと　だけだぞ▼
リバースマウンテン▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:07:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>一言　だけだぞ▼
リバースマウンテン▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:12:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>目的地メッセージ
・リバースマウンテンでベルと連れ歩き前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:54:38" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_09"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いま　サザナミあたり　かな▼
そうだな……　ひさしぶりに
オマエと　しょうぶ　するか▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:07:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いま　サザナミあたり　かな▼
そうだな……　久しぶりに
オマエと　勝負するか▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:12:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>目的地メッセージ
・サザナミでのライバル戦闘前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:54:40" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレは　ソウリュウシティの
ポケモンジムを　めざしてる▼
ジムリーダーは　かなり
てごわいって　はなし　だぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:02:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレは　ソウリュウシティの
ポケモンジムを　めざしてる▼
ジムリーダーは　かなり
手ごわいって　話しだぜ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:13:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>目的地メッセージ
・c08ポケモンジムクリア前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:54:42" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_11"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぶじ　か！▼
オレは　セイガイハ　だから
すぐには　いけないけど▽
オマエなら　だいじょうぶ　だろ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:01:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぶじ　か！▼
オレは　セイガイハ　だから
すぐには　いけないけど▽
オマエなら　だいじょうぶ　だろ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:08:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>目的地メッセージ
・c08でチェレンと会話する前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:54:44" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_12"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……プラズマだんは　さがしてる
ぜんぜん　みつからないけどな！▼
おまえは　セイガイハの
シズイって　ジムリーダーを▽
さっさと　たおしてこいよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:31:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……プラズマだんは　さがしてる
ぜんぜん　みつからないけどな！▼
おまえは　セイガイハの
シズイって　ジムリーダーを▽
さっさと　たおしてこいよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:08:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>目的地メッセージ
・c14ポケモンジムクリア前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:54:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_13"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレは
プラズマフリゲートを　さがしてる！▽
オマエも　てわけ　してくれよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:00:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレは
プラズマフリゲートを　探してる！▽
オマエも　手分け　してくれよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:13:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
