			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_14"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……！？▼
いま　ライブキャスターで
はなしてる　ばあい　かよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:21:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……！？▼
いま　ライブキャスターで
話してる　場合かよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:13:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>目的地メッセージ
・プラズマフリゲート２回目クリア前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:54:52" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_15"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>チャンピオンロードを　こえたら
ポケモンリーグ　だぜ▼
チャンピオンロードは
２３ばんどうろの　さきだよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:22:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>チャンピオンロードを　越えたら
ポケモンリーグ　だぜ▼
チャンピオンロードは
２３番道路の　先だよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:13:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>目的地メッセージ
・チャンピオンロード到達前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:54:53" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_16"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ふうん　いま
チャンピオンロードか▼
だったら　もうすぐ
ポケモンリーグ　だな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T12:22:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ふうん　いま
チャンピオンロードか▼
だったら　もうすぐ
ポケモンリーグ　だな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:08:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>目的地メッセージ
・ポケモンリーグ到達前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
