	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_RIVAL_SP_19"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>？？？に　いるよ▼
ヒマなら　くれば？
あいて　してやるから▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:40:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ホドモエに　いるよ▼
ヒマなら　来れば？
相手してやるから▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:14:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:40:41" />
