		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_GREET_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>やぁ[Ctrl2:PageClear ]</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>やぁ[Ctrl2:PageClear ]</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いいかい？▼
モンスターボールは　つねに
きらさない　ように　すること▼
いつ　どこで　どんな　ポケモンと
であうか　わからない▼
チャンスは　やってくると　しんじて
じゅんび　しておかないとね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:29:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いいかい？▼
モンスターボールは　常に
きらさない　ように　すること▼
いつ　どこで　どんな　ポケモンと
出会うか　わからない▼
チャンスは　やってくると　信じて
準備して　おかないとね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:20:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンしょうぶでの
ほんとうの　はいぼくは▽
あきらめるってこと！▼
まけた　りゆうを　かんがえ
どう　おぎなうか　くふうする▼
そして　チャレンジしつづければ
まえの　じぶんを　こえられる▼
だけど　なにも　しなければ
ぜったいに　かてないからね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:34:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:50:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモン勝負での
本当の　はいぼくは▽
あきらめるってこと！▼
負けた　理由を　考え
どう　補うか　工夫する▼
そして　チャレンジしつづければ
前の　自分を　超えられる▼
だけど　なにも　しなければ
絶対に　勝てないからね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:21:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:50:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:50:57" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うーん▼
ポケモンの　ちしきを
おしえるのも　だいじだけど▼
なにより　ポケモンと　いると
たのしいって　しってほしいな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:22:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>うーん▼
ポケモンの　知識を
教えるのも　大事だけど▼
なにより　ポケモンと　いると
楽しいって　知ってほしいな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:22:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>しんじつも……
りそうも……▼
ひとの　かず……　いや
ポケモンと　ひとの　かずだけ
あるんだよね　きっと▼
だから　せいかい　って
あるともいえるし　ないともいえるね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:23:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>真実も……
理想も……▼
人の　数……　いや
ポケモンと　人の　数だけ
あるんだよね　きっと▼
だから　正解って
あるともいえるし　ないともいえるね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:23:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぼくが　メガネを　はずして
ベルが　メガネを　かけてて……▼
ひさしぶりに　あったとき
すごく　おどろいたよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:26:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぼくが　メガネを　はずして
ベルが　メガネを　かけてて……▼
ひさしぶりに　会ったとき
すごく　驚いたよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:24:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:02" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こどもの　ころ
めかくし　して　すごすという▽
じっけんを　したよ▼
そうすることで
かんかくが　きたえられる……▽
そんなふうに　かんがえていたんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T06:50:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>こどもの　ころ
目隠し　して　過ごすという▽
実験を　したよ▼
そうすることで
感覚が　鍛えられる……▽
そんな風に　考えていたんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:24:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぼくのこと　だけど
ジムリーダーとして　おかしくない？▼
あっ
ゴメンゴメン！▼
そんなこと　こたえづらいよね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:23:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぼくのこと　だけど
ジムリーダーとして　おかしくない？▼
あっ
ゴメンゴメン！▼
そんなこと　こたえづらいよね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:39:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>じぶんに　じしんが　ないときは
チャンピオンとかの　かたがきで▽
じぶんを　ひょうげん　したくなるけど▽
それは　うわべの　ことなんだよね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:09:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>自分に　自信が　ないときは
チャンピオンとかの　肩書きで▽
自分を　表現したくなるけど▽
それは　上辺の　ことなんだよね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:25:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_09"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちしきが　あっても
ちえが　ないと　ダメなのかもね▼
ちしきは　あくまでも　じょうほう
じょうほうを　どう　いかせるか？▽
それが　だいじだと　おもうんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:08:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>知識が　あっても
知恵が　ないと　ダメなのかもね▼
知識は　あくまでも　情報
情報を　どう　いかせるか？▽
それが　大事だと　思うんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:25:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_TALK_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きになることは　しらべる
そして　じっさいに　たしかめる▼
あたま　だけで
わかったつもりで　いると▽
いろいろ　いたいめに　あうからね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:06:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>気になることは　調べる
そして　実際に　たしかめる▼
頭だけで
わかったつもりで　いると▽
いろいろ　痛い目に　あうからね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:26:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_CHELEN_BYE_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>じゃ　またね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T04:58:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>じゃ　またね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T04:58:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>さよなら選択時</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:20" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_GREET_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こんにちは！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:44:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>こんにちは！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:44:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment />
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:22" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:20" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きょうは　どんな　かんじ？▼
いい　かんじ　だったら
すっごく　たのしいし▼
いまいち　だったら
あしたが　すごく　たのしいはずだよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T04:49:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きょうは　どんな　感じ？▼
いい　感じ　だったら
すっごく　楽しいし▼
いまいち　だったら
明日が　すごく　楽しいはずだよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:26:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:23" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンと　であうため
くさむらに　はいるのって▽
いつになっても　ドキドキするよ▼
あの　きもち　いつまでも
ぜったいに　わすれないよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:28:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンと　出会うため
草むらに　入るのって▽
いつになっても　ドキドキするよ▼
あの気持ち　いつまでも
絶対に　忘れないよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:26:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アララギはかせの　おてつだいで
たっくさん　ほんを　よんでいたら▽
メガネを　かけるように　なったの▼
あたしとしては
にあってるつもり　だよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:27:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アララギ博士の　お手伝いで
たっくさん　本を　読んでいたら▽
メガネを　かけるように　なったの▼
あたしとしては
似合ってるつもり　だよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:27:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>モンスターボールを
１０こ　まとめて　かうとね▼
な　な　なんと！
プレミアボールを　１こ▽
もらえて　しまうんだよ！▼
すごいよねえ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:23:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>モンスターボールを
１０個　まとめて　買うと▼
な　な　なんと！
プレミアボールを　１個▽
もらえて　しまうんだよ！▼
すごいよねえ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:28:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ねえねえ　いきなりだけど
あたし　おもうんだ！▼
ともだちって　あえなくても
ともだち　だよね　きっと！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T05:21:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ねえねえ　いきなりだけど
あたし　思うんだ！▼
ともだちって　会えなくても
ともだち　だよね　きっと！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:30:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>えーっとね
むかしのこと　おもいだしてたの▼
といっても　そんな
むかしじゃなくて　というか▽
つい　さいきん　なのかな？▼
ポケモンを　もらって
ポケモンずかんを　たくされ▽
たびを　はじめたときの　ことだよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:31:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>えーっとね
昔のこと　思い出してたの▼
といっても　そんな
昔じゃなくて　というか▽
つい　最近　なのかな？▼
ポケモンを　もらって
ポケモン図鑑を　託され▽
旅を　はじめたときの　ことだよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:31:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ねえねえ▼
ポケモンと　はなせたら
うれしい？　それとも　こまる？▼
あたしは　じぶんの　ポケモンに
いつも　はなしかけてるけど▽
へんじしたら　どうするのかなあ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:31:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ねえねえ▼
ポケモンと　話せたら
うれしい？　それとも　困る？▼
あたしは　自分の　ポケモンに
いつも　話しかけてるけど▽
返事したら　どうするのかなあ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:31:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンの
いちばんの　ふしぎ……▼
それは　ひとと
いっしょに　いること！▼
それを　けんきゅうテーマに
しようかな　なんて　おもってるの▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:54:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンの
一番の　不思議……▼
それは　人と
一緒に　いること！▼
それを　研究テーマに
しようかな　なんて　思ってるの▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:32:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_09"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたしはね
ポケモンの　けんきゅうを▽
はじめたばかり　というか▼
まだ　おてつだい　だけど
ぜったいに　ポケモンの　すべてを▽
ときあかすなんて　むりでしょ▼
それを　わかっていて
けんきゅうを　つづける　はかせって▽
すごいと　おもうんだよねえ……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:50:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたしはね
ポケモンの　研究を▽
始めたばかり　というか▼
まだ　お手伝い　だけど
絶対に　ポケモンの　すべてを▽
解き明かすなんて　無理でしょ▼
それを　わかっていて
研究を　続ける　博士って▽
すごいと　尊敬するんだよねえ……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:33:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_TALK_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……　……　……
……　……　……▼
ああ！　ごめんね▼
いま　きになる
ポケモンが　とびだしたから……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:47:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……　……　……
……　……　……▼
ああ！　ごめんね▼
いま　気になる
ポケモンが　飛び出したから……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:33:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T04:05:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_BELL_BYE_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>またねえ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:42:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>またねえ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:42:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>さよなら選択時</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:23" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_GREET_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おっ
げんきそうな　こえね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:24:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おっ
元気そうな　声ね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:24:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いっしょに　たびをする
ポケモンは　ふえたの？▼
たびは　にぎやかな　ほうが
ぜったいに　たのしいわよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:44:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>一緒に　旅をする
ポケモンは　増えたの？▼
旅は　にぎやかな　方が
絶対に　楽しいわよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:34:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:30:42" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きょうの　こんだては
なにに　しようかなー？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:44:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:30" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きょうの　献立は
なにに　しようかなー？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:35:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:30" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:28" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いろんな　ポケモンが　いて
おなじ　しゅるいの　ポケモンでも▽
せいかくとか　ぜんぜん　ちがうのよ▼
あなたに　ぴったりの
ポケモンは　どんな　ポケモンかな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:35:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いろんな　ポケモンが　いて
同じ　種類の　ポケモンでも▽
性格とか　ぜんぜん　違うのよ▼
あなたに　ぴったりの
ポケモンは　どんな　ポケモンかな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:35:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンに　しんらい　されるには
まず　いっしょに　あるくこと！▼
そうすれば　あなたの
いろんなことを　しってもらえるわよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:32:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンに　信頼されるには
まず　一緒に　歩くこと！▼
そうすれば　あなたの
いろんなことを　知ってもらえるわよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:35:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いえの　ことは　だいじょうぶよ！▼
あなたが　いつ
かえってきても　いいように▼
ベッドの　シーツは
まいにち　あらってるから！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:41:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いえの　ことは　大丈夫よ！▼
あなたが　いつ
帰ってきても　いいように▼
ベッドの　シーツは
毎日　洗ってるから！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:36:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いきなり　マジメに　なっちゃうけど▼
あなたが　うまれたとき
すでに　ポケモンは　いたよね▼
それって　あたりまえ　だけど
あたりまえの　ことを　なぜ？　って▽
かんがえるのも　たび　かもね？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:40:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いきなり　マジメに　なっちゃうけど▼
あなたが　生まれたとき
すでに　ポケモンは　いたよね▼
それって　当たり前　だけど
当たり前の　ことを　なぜ？　って▽
考えるのも　旅かもね？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:36:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンセンターの
うけつけの　ひとはね　いがいと▽
トレーナーのこと　おぼえているのよ▼
もちろん　いっしょに　いる
ポケモンたちの　こともね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:33:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンセンターの
受付の　人はね　意外と▽
トレーナーのこと　覚えているのよ▼
もちろん　一緒に　いる
ポケモンたちの　こともね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:36:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモン　いっぱい　つかまえた？▼
じゃあ　たまには
ポケモンセンターの　ボックスを　みて▼
あなたと　たびを　したがっている
ポケモンが　いるかもよ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:38:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモン　いっぱい　捕まえた？▼
じゃあ　たまには
ポケモンセンターの　ボックスを　みて▼
あなたと　旅を　したがっている
ポケモンが　いるかもよ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:36:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_09"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンセンターは
みんなの　いえ！▼
そういうつもりで　えんりょなく
りよう　すれば　いいのよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:35:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンセンターは
みんなの　家！▼
そういうつもりで　遠慮なく
利用すれば　いいのよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:37:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_TALK_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おこづかいは　たりてる？▼
なんて　きいてみたけど
あなたなら　だいじょうぶ　よね！▼
だけど　ムダづかいは　だめよ
いざというとき　こまるから▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:36:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おこづかいは　足りてる？▼
なんて　きいてみたけど
あなたなら　大丈夫よね！▼
だけど　無駄使いは　だめよ
いざというとき　困るから▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T10:37:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>はなす/話す選択時
・ランダム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:17:35" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-29T02:51:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="CALL_MOTHER_BYE_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>はーい！
じゃあ　げんき　でねー！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:19:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
